ame 8: Close-up of a hand holding a bright yellow crown-shaped prop with a black handle.  \n- Frame 17: Two hands holding yellow crowns in front of the stage.  \n- Frame 26: A woman holds a yellow crown prop near her face.  \n- Frame 30: The main character holds a yellow crown prop while smiling at the camera.  \n- No glow sticks (typical cylindrical or tubular light-emitting objects) are visible — only structured, shaped light sticks.\n\n---\n\n**Temporal Sequence & Context:**  \nThe props appear consistently across multiple concert segments — from wide crowd shots (frames 4–9, 23–30) to close-ups (frames 8, 26, 30). This indicates they are official or fan-organized props used throughout the concert, not isolated or random items.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**  \n✅ The answer **‘1’ (Yellow crown props)** is **correct**. The audience members are clearly holding yellow, crown-shaped light sticks during the concert performances. No other prop type (like glow sticks) dominates the visual evidence. The props are visible, consistent in shape and color, and used actively by the crowd during stage events.'}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0344.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0345.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0346.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0347.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0348.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0349.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0350.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0351.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0352.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0536.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0537.jpg